{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "爱理", "steam": "愛理"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "愛理"}, "voice": {"chs": "ar3201", "steam": "ar3201", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「谢谢你，安洁。能让引人注目的安洁\\n　带头呼吁，真的帮了我们大忙了」", "steam": "「謝謝妳，安潔。有引人注目的安潔幫我們一起喊，真的幫了很大的忙。」"}, "length": {"chs": 35, "steam": 33}, "similarity": 0.464}
