{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "安洁", "steam": "アンジェ"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "安潔"}, "voice": {"chs": "ag0600", "steam": "ag0600", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「而且新吾同学，爱理同学，\\n　这样子试着站在校门这，\\n　有没有明白了些什么呢？」", "steam": "「而且新吾同學、愛理同學。像這樣站在校門口，有沒有發現什麼事呢？」"}, "length": {"chs": 42, "steam": 33}, "similarity": 0.452}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「诶……怎么说呢」", "steam": "「欸……什麼事？」"}, "length": {"chs": 9, "steam": 9}, "similarity": 0.0}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "安洁", "steam": "アンジェ"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "安潔"}, "voice": {"chs": "ag0601", "steam": "ag0601", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「安洁觉得，\\n　各位学生比起10月初那会儿，\\n　都变得俊男靓女了起来」", "steam": "「所有學生們比起１０月剛開始的時候，都變帥、變可愛了呢～安潔是這麼覺得的。」"}, "length": {"chs": 37, "steam": 38}, "similarity": 0.308}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "爱理", "steam": "愛理"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "愛理"}, "voice": {"chs": "ar3202", "steam": "ar3202", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「诶……啊……嗯，这么说的话也确实……」", "steam": "「欸……啊……嗯，這樣一說的確……」"}, "length": {"chs": 20, "steam": 18}, "similarity": 0.3}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "因为成天都被各务台的男生们看着，\\n所以结女校的女生们也从不疏忽大意。", "steam": "因為有我們各務台的男生在，結女的學生們都開始注重了起來。"}, "length": {"chs": 35, "steam": 28}, "similarity": 0.339}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "可能因为面对的都是结女校的大小姐们——\\n各务台的学生们也都一刻都没有松懈。", "steam": "反過來說，因為同學們是大小姐──各務台的人也不會讓自己鬆懈下來。"}, "length": {"chs": 38, "steam": 32}, "similarity": 0.299}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "想到了之前校长在全校大会上面说的那些话了。", "steam": "我想起以前學園長在全校集會上說過的話。"}, "length": {"chs": 21, "steam": 19}, "similarity": 0.368}
